pan><span>14s</span></p><p>Anthropic's philosopher on why real decisions need context, not just narrow theory.</p><p>askell-anthropic-interview</p></div></div><div><h3>Find Highlights</h3><p>Instantly surface the strongest moments from long-form footage.</p></div></div><div><div><video><source><source></video><div><p>Okay, here's what nobody tells you</p></div></div><div><h3>Captions</h3><p>Generate animated captions with multiple cinematic styles.</p></div></div><div><h3>Fast Rendering</h3><p>Turn 1 hour of footage into a finished render in around 5 minutes.</p></div></div></section><div><div><div><div><div><p><span>🇩🇰</span></p></div><div><p><span>🇳🇱</span></p></div><div><p><span>🇺🇸</span></p></div><div><p><span>🇫🇷</span></p></div><div><p><span>🇩🇪</span></p></div></div><p>English (US)</p><p><span>5<!-- --> / <!-- -->23</span></p></div><div><p></p><h3>Translate Your Videos</h3><p></p><p>Make your videos available in multiple languages without re-recording a single word.</p></div></div><div><div><div><p><img></p></div><div><h4>Motion Settings</h4><p>Bezier Curve</p><p>Scale</p></div></div><p><span>Coming soon</span></p><div><div><h3>Motion Graphics</h3><p><span>Coming soon</span></p></div><p>Animated overlays and cinematic graphics for polished edits.</p></div></div><div><div><p>M</p><p>S</p><p>I</p><p>+2</p></div><div><div><h3>Sharing</h3><p><span>Coming soon</span></p></div><p>Share edits, collect feedback, and collaborate in real time.</p></div></div><div><p></p><h3>Remove dead air</h3><p></p><p>Strip out the “ums,” “ahs,” awkward pauses, and silences that slow your videos down.</p></div></div><section><div><h2>Polish the Final Cut</h2><div><div><h3>Translate Captions</h3><p>Translate captions across multiple languages instantly.</p></div><div><h3>Voice Dubbing</h3><p>Dub your video into any language with AI voiceovers.</p></div><div><h3>Audio Ducking</h3><p>Keep voices clear by lowering the music whenever someone speaks.</p></div><div><h3>Audio Cleanup</h3><p>Remove background noise so voices come through clearly.</p></div><div><h3>Volume Leveling</h3><p>Balance loud and quiet moments automatically across your video.</p></div><div><h3>Color Grade</h3><p>Color grade and set exposure so every shot looks consistent.</p></div><div><h3>Background Music</h3><p>Add the right soundtrack from a built-in music library.</p></div><div><h3>Export Presets</h3><p>Export videos in the right format for every platform.</p></div><div><h3>Translate Captions</h3><p>Translate captions across multiple languages instantly.</p></div><div><h3>Voice Dubbing</h3><p>Dub your video into any language with AI voiceovers.</p></div><div><h3>Audio Ducking</h3><p>Keep voices clear by lowering the music whenever someone speaks.</p></div><div><h3>Audio Cleanup</h3><p>Remove background noise so voices come through clearly.</p></div><div><h3>Volume Leveling</h3><p>Balance loud and quiet moments automatically across your video.</p></div><div><h3>Color Grade</h3><p>Color grade and set exposure so every shot looks consistent.</p></div><div><h3>Background Music</h3><p>Add the right soundtrack from a built-in music library.</p></div><div><h3>Export Presets</h3><p>Export videos in the right format for every platform.</p></div></div></div><div><h2>Polish the Final Cut</h2><div><div><h3>Translate Captions</h3><p>Translate captions across multiple languages instantly.</p></div><div><h3>Voice Dubbing</h3><p>Dub your video into any language with AI voiceovers.</p></div><div><h3>Audio Ducking</h3><p>Keep voices clear by lowering the music whenever someone speaks.</p></div><div><h3>Audio Cleanup</h3><p>Remove background noise so voices come through clearly.</p></div><div><h3>Volume Leveling</h3><p>Balance loud and quiet moments automatically across your video.</p></div><div><h3>Color Grade</h3><p>Color grade and set exposure so every shot looks consistent.</p></div><div><h3>Background Music</h3><p>Add the right soundtrack from a built-in music library.</p></div><div><h3>Export Presets</h3><p>Export videos in the right format for every platform.</p></div></div></div></section><section><div><h2>Direct Your Edit With<!-- --> <span>Prompts</span></h2><p>Turn raw footage into structured edits with intelligent timeline decisions and automated workflows.</p></div><div><p><label>Prompt</label></p></div></section><div><p></p><h2>See What Cardboard Can Create</h2><p></p></div><div><h2>What do you want to make?</h2><p>Describe it and Cardboard cuts the first version. Pricing starts at<!-- --> <strong>$<!-- -->32<!-- -->/month</strong>.</p><p>Not sure yet?<!-- --> Explore plans</p></div></div></div>",
