              \n              \n              <div>\n                \n                  <p>Upstage's sparse hybrid alternates one gated GQA layer with three Kimi Delta Attention layers and reaches a 1M-token context without positional embeddings.</p>\n                \n                <dl>\n                  <p>\n                    </p><dt>Scale</dt>\n                    <dd>250B total, 15B active (6% active)</dd>\n                  <p></p>\n                  <p>\n                    </p><dt>Context (tokens)</dt>\n                    <dd>1,048,576</dd>\n                  <p></p>\n                  \n                    <p>\n                      </p><dt>Vocabulary</dt>\n                      <dd>196,608 (~197k)</dd>\n                    <p></p>\n                  \n                  <p>\n                    </p><dt>License</dt>\n                    <dd>Upstage Solar License</dd>\n                  <p></p>\n                  <p>\n                    </p><dt>Date</dt>\n                    <dd>2026-07-22</dd>\n                  <p></p>\n                  <p>\n                    </p><dt>Decoder type</dt>\n                    <dd>Sparse hybrid</dd>\n                  <p></p>\n                  <p>\n                    </p><dt>Attention</dt>\n                    <dd>3:1 Kimi Delta Attention and gated GQA with NoPE</dd>\n                  <p></p>\n                  <p>\n                    </p><dt>Layer mix</dt>\n                    <dd>12 gated GQA + 36 Kimi Delta Attention</dd>\n                  <p></p>\n                  <p>\n                    </p><dt>\n                      KV cache / token (bf16)\n                      \n                        info\n                      \n                    </dt>\n                    <dd>\n                      48 KiB · Low\n                    </dd>\n                  <p></p>\n                  <p>\n                    </p><dt>Key detail</dt>\n                    <dd>Uses a repeating gated-GQA/KDA hybrid stack, kernel-4 ShortConv in KDA, and top-8 routing over 320 experts plus one shared expert.</dd>\n                  <p></p>\n                  \n                  \n                  \n                </dl>\n                <div>\n                      <p>Related concepts</p>\n                      <p>RMSNorm\n                        \n                        \n                          \n                          \n                          \n                            \n                            \n                              GQA\n                            \n                          \n                        \n                          \n                          \n                          \n                            \n                            \n                              Gated Attention\n                            \n                          \n                        \n                          \n                          \n                          \n                            \n                            \n                              Hybrid Attention\n                            \n                          \n                        \n                          \n                          \n                          \n                            \n                            \n                              ShortConv\n                            \n                          \n                        \n                          \n                          \n                          \n                            \n                            \n                              NoPE\n                            \n                          \n                        \n                          \n                          \n                          \n                            \n                            \n                              MoE\n                            \n                          \n                        \n                          \n                 