  <p>\n                    </p><dt>Scale</dt>\n                    <dd>2.8T total, 104B active (3.7% active)</dd>\n                  <p></p>\n                  <p>\n                    </p><dt>Context (tokens)</dt>\n                    <dd>1,048,576</dd>\n                  <p></p>\n                  \n                  <p>\n                    </p><dt>License</dt>\n                    <dd>Kimi K3 License</dd>\n                  <p></p>\n                  <p>\n                    </p><dt>Date</dt>\n                    <dd>2026-07-27</dd>\n                  <p></p>\n                  <p>\n                    </p><dt>Decoder type</dt>\n                    <dd>Sparse hybrid</dd>\n                  <p></p>\n                  <p>\n                    </p><dt>Attention</dt>\n                    <dd>3:1 Kimi Delta Attention and Gated MLA with NoPE</dd>\n                  <p></p>\n                  <p>\n                    </p><dt>Layer mix</dt>\n                    <dd>69 KDA + 24 Gated MLA</dd>\n                  <p></p>\n                  <p>\n                    </p><dt>\n                      KV cache / token (bf16)\n                      \n                        info\n                      \n                    </dt>\n                    <dd>\n                      27 KiB · Low\n                    </dd>\n                  <p></p>\n                  <p>\n                    </p><dt>Key detail</dt>\n                    <dd>Uses eight Block Attention Residual groups and Stable LatentMoE with 16 of 896 routed experts active per token.</dd>\n                  <p></p>\n                  \n                  \n                  \n                    <p>\n                      </p><dt>\n                        AA Intelligence Index\n                        \n                          info\n                        \n                      </dt>\n                      <dd>\n                        \n                        \n                          <span>\n                    