\n            \n              \n              \n              \n              <div>\n                \n                  <p>Meta's dense 29.6B multimodal model combines a 52-layer sandwich-norm decoder with gated GQA and a separate perception encoder; the figure focuses on the text backbone.</p>\n                \n                <dl>\n                  <p>\n                    </p><dt>Scale</dt>\n                    <dd>29.6B parameters (including perception encoder)</dd>\n                  <p></p>\n                  <p>\n                    </p><dt>Context (tokens)</dt>\n                    <dd>131,072+</dd>\n                  <p></p>\n                  \n                    <p>\n                      </p><dt>Vocabulary</dt>\n                      <dd>202,048 (~202k)</dd>\n                    <p></p>\n                  \n                  <p>\n                    </p><dt>License</dt>\n                    <dd>Apache License 2.0</dd>\n                  <p></p>\n                  <p>\n                    </p><dt>Date</dt>\n                    <dd>2026-08-10</dd>\n                  <p></p>\n                  <p>\n                    </p><dt>Decoder type</dt>\n                    <dd>Dense</dd>\n                  <p></p>\n                  <p>\n                    </p><dt>Attention</dt>\n                    <dd>Gated GQA with scaleless QK-Norm, local-only RoPE, global NoPE, and 3:1 sliding-window/global attention</dd>\n                  <p></p>\n                  <p>\n                    </p><dt>Layer mix</dt>\n                    <dd>39 sliding-window + 13 global gated GQA</dd>\n                  <p></p>\n                  <p>\n                    </p><dt>\n                      KV cache / token (bf16)\n                      \n                        info\n                      \n                    </dt>\n                    <dd>\n                      52 KiB · Low\n                    </dd>\n                  <p></p>\n                  <p>\n                    </p><dt>Key detail</dt>\n                    <dd>Applies RoPE only in 2,048-token local layers, uses NoPE in global layers, and gates the attention output before projection.</dd>\n                  <p></p>\n                  \n                  \n                  \n                </dl>\n                <div>\n                      <p>Related concepts</p>\n                      <p>RMSNorm\n                        \n                        \n                          \n                          \n                          \n                            \n                            \n                              GQA\n                            \n                          \n                        \n                          \n                          \n                          \n                            \n                            \n                              QK-Norm\n                            \n                          \n                        \n                          \n                          \n                          \n                            \n                            \n                              SWA\n                            \n                          \n                        \n                          \n                          \n                          \n                            \n                            \n                              Gated Attention\n                            \n                          \n                        \n                          \n                          \n                          \n                            \n                            \n                              NoPE\n                            \n                          \n                        \n                          \n                          \n                          \n                            \n                            \n                              RoPE\n                            \n                 