    "text": "<div><div><main><section><div><p>Search any file.<br> Two API calls.<br><span>100%</span> Needle in a Haystack.</p><p>MRAG-Bench, ICLR</p><p>Get an API keySee the benchmarks</p></div><div><div><h2>Stop burning time <br>on spotty RAG.</h2><p>Effortlessly ship multi-modal context pipelines with Captain as a tool call.</p></div><div><div><p><span>captain</span></p><p><span>Building RAG manually</span></p></div><div><p><span>Universal Indexing</span><span>Auto OCR + VLM, file conversions, best-in-class embeddings</span></p><div><div><p>ETL / ELT</p></div><div><p>Pre-Processing &amp; OCR</p></div><div><p>Chunking Strategy</p></div><div><p>Embedding Model</p></div></div></div><div><p><span>Captain Collections</span><span>Managed storage (no external database needed)</span></p><div><p>Vector Database</p></div></div><div><p><span>Agentic + Hybrid Search</span><span>Weighted search for keywords and semantic relevance</span></p><div><div><p>Query Embedding</p></div><div><p>Similarity Lookup</p></div><div><p>Re-Ranking</p></div><div><p>Prompt Engineering</p></div></div></div><div><p><span>+95% Accuracy</span><br><span>Deploy in minutes · No ops</span></p><p><span>~78% Accuracy</span><br><span>3-6 months · Scale and maintain</span></p></div></div></div></section><div><h2>Connect Your Existing Systems</h2><p><span>Integrate quickly with your cloud services.</span><span>Integrate quickly with your Data Lake, or Cloud Storage<span> solutions</span>.</span></p><div><p><img><span>Azure Blob</span></p><p><img><span>GCP Storage</span></p><p><img><span>Amazon S3</span></p><p><img><span>SharePoint</span></p><p><img><span>Google Drive</span></p><p><img><span>Dropbox</span></p><p><span>1,000 Custom Options</span></p><p><img><span>Confluence</span></p><p><img><span>Slack</span></p><p><img><span>Gmail</span></p><p><img><span>Notion</span></p></div><div><div><p><span>Most Popular</span><img></p><div><p>Upload from SharePoint</p><p>Bring the power of Microsoft 365 to Captain</p></div></div><div><p><span>API First</span></p><p><img><span>/</span><img><span>/</span><img></p><div><p>Index your Cloud</p><p>Connect S3 / GCS / Azure</p></div></div></div></div><div><h2>Granular and Secure.</h2><p>Map Role-Based Access and pass SOC 2 requirements.</p><div><div><div><p><img></p></div><div><h3>Role-Based Governance</h3><p>Attach custom metadata to files at index time, then filter queries with granular operators to enforce role-based access across any collection.</p><p>Read the Docs</p></div></div><div><p><img></p><div><div><h3>SOC 2 Certified</h3><p>Enterprise-grade infrastructure security;<br>Independently audited and pentested. Read our security report and compliance posture below:</p></div><p>Learn more</p></div></div></div></div><div><h2><span>On the <span>Radar</span></span><span><span></span><span></span></span></h2><p>Find the latest news, updates, and stories on Captain.</p></div><div><h2>Pricing</h2><div><div><div><p><img></p><h3>Free Tier</h3><p>Predictable base, pay for what you use</p></div><div><div><p><span><span>500</span> indexing credits/mo</span></p></div><div><p><span><span>$0.02</span> per overage credit</span></p></div><div><p><span><span>1,000</span> queries/mo included</span></p></div><div><p><span>Then <span>$0.005</span> per query</span></p></div><div><p><span>No commitment, cancel anytime</span></p></div></div><div><p>$0/mo</p><p>Get Started Free</p></div></div><div><p><span>Most Popular</span></p><div><p><img></p><h3>Startup</h3><p>Save with bulk credits</p></div><div><div><p><span><span>83,000</span> credits/mo</span></p></div><div><p><span><span>$0.015</span> per overage credit</span></p></div><div><p><span>Unlimited queries</span></p></div><div><p><span>Production-ready infrastructure</span></p></div><div><p><span>Compliance-ready infrastructure</span></p></div><div><p><span>Background backup protection</span></p></div><div><p><span>Slack support</span></p></div></div><div><p>$1,600/mo</p><p>Get Started</p></div></div><div><div><p><img></p><h3>Enterprise</h3><p>For custom arrangements</p></div><div><div><p><span>Unlocks <span>Captain Datasets</span> <span>New!</span></span></p></div><div><p><span>BYOC (On-Premise) available</span></p></div><div><p><span>Dedicated support</span></p></div><div><p><span>Unlimited queries</span></p></div></div><div><p>Custom pricing</p><p>Contact Us</p></div></div></div><p>How do credits work?</p></div><div><h2>Command your data</h2><p>Get an API KeyLet's talk</p></div></main></div></div>",
