    "source": "HackerNews (Distributed)",
    "category": "Technology",
    "title": "Pijul — A Distributed Version Control System",
    "url": "https://pijul.org/",
    "text": "<div><div> <main><!--[--><div><div><p><span>VCS</span> <span>·</span> <span>pijul.org</span> <span>·</span> <span>DISTRIBUTED · CORRECT · OPEN SOURCE</span></p> <div><p>pijul</p> <p>A distributed version control system built on a mathematically sound theory of patches —\n        fast, composable, and correct by construction.</p> <p>install nest.pijul.com ↗ blog</p></div></div> <p>why pijul</p> <div><div><p>commutation</p> <div><p>Independent changes can be applied in <strong>any order</strong> without changing the\n          result or the version identifier. No more <code>git rebase</code> ceremony.</p> <p>Feature branches are often just changes in Pijul. Keeping history clean is the default.</p></div></div> <div><p>merge correctness</p> <div><p>Strong guarantees on merges. The <strong>order between lines is always preserved</strong>,\n          unlike 3-way merge which can silently shuffle content.</p> <p>When order is genuinely unknown, Pijul surfaces a conflict — never silently wrong output.</p></div></div> <div><p>first-class conflicts</p> <div><p>Once resolved, conflict resolutions applies to the same two changes everywhere. Conflicts\n          never come back.</p> <p>Conflicts are not a failure to merge in Pijul, they happen between two changes and are\n          resolved by one change. Just like everything else.</p></div></div> <div><p>partial clones</p> <div><p>Commutation makes it possible to clone only a <strong>subset of a repository</strong>.\n          Working on a partial clone produces changes that merge cleanly into the full repo.</p> <p>Ideal for monorepos: work on just the parts you care about.</p></div></div></div> <p>get started</p> <div><p>bootstrap — pijul is developed with pijul</p> <div><div><p>quick install</p> <pre>$ cargo install pijul --version \"~1.0.0-beta\"</pre> <p>clone source</p> <pre>$ pijul clone https://nest.pijul.com/pijul/pijul</pre> <p>more install options →</p></div> <div><p>repository</p> <p>nest.pijul.com/pijul/pijul</p><p>Hosted on the Nest — Pijul's own repository hosting platform.</p> <p>free hosting ↗</p></div></div></div> <p>see it in action</p> <div> <!--[0--><div><p><span></span> <span></span> <span></span> <span>git</span></p> <p><span></span> <span></span> <span></span> <span>pijul</span></p></div> <!--[--><!--[-1--><!--]--> <div><div><!--[--><!--[3--><p><span>git $</span> <span>printf 'A\\nB\\n' &gt; f.txt</span></p> <!--[-1--><!--]--><!--]--><!--[3--><p><span>git $</span> <span>git add f.txt</span></p> <!--[-1--><!--]--><!--]--><!--[3--><p><span>git $</span> <span>git commit -m 'base'</span></p> <!--[0--><pre><!---->[main (root-commit) 46fcdd3] base\n 1 file changed, 2 insertions(+)\n create mode 100644 f.txt<!----></pre><!--]--><!--]--><!--]--><!----></div> <div><!--[--><!--[3--><p><span>pijul $</span> <span>pijul init</span></p> <!--[0--><pre><!---->Repository created at /tmp/pijul<!----></pre><!--]--><!--]--><!--[3--><p><span>pijul $</span> <span>printf 'A\\nB\\n' &gt; f.txt</span></p> <!--[-1--><!--]--><!--]--><!--[3--><p><span>pijul $</span> <span>pijul add f.txt</span></p> <!--[0--><pre><!---->Tracked 1 path(s)<!----></pre><!--]--><!--]--><!--[3--><p><span>pijul $</span> <span>pijul record -am 'base'</span></p> <!--[0--><pre><!---->Hash: 3WW3T5GBOOR3OCU2IDEVHHA7GGXMOHJDOYHCH7L5BWUGHUBHHQIQC<!----></pre><!--]--><!--]--><!--]--><!----></div></div><!--[0--><!--]--> <div><div><!--[--><!--[3--><p><span>git $</span> <span>git checkout -b alice</span></p> <!--[0--><pre><!---->Switched to a new branch 'alice'<!----></pre><!--]--><!--]--><!--[3--><p><span>git $</span> <span>printf 'G\\nA\\nB\\n' &gt; f.txt</span></p> <!--[-1--><!--]--><!--]--><!--[3--><p><span>git $</span> <span>git commit -am 'add G at top'</span></p> <!--[0--><pre><!---->[alice abfb5f1] add G at top\n 1 file changed, 1 insertion(+)<!----></pre><!--]--><!--]--><!--[3--><p><span>git $</span> <span>cat f.txt</span></p> <!--[0--><pre><!---->G\nA\nB<!----></pre><!--]--><!--]--><!--]--><!----></div> <div><!--[--><!--[3--><p><span>pijul $</span> <span>pijul fork alice</span></p> <!--[-1--><!--]--><!--]--><!--[3--><p><span>pijul $</span> <span>pijul channel switch alice</span></p> <!--[0--><pre><!---->Reset given paths to last recorded change<!----></pre><!--]--><!--]--><!--[3--><p><span>pijul $</span> <span>printf 'G\\nA\\nB\\n' &gt; f.txt</span></p> <!--[-1--><!--]--><!--]--><!--[3--><p><span>pijul $</span> <span>pijul record -am 'add G at top'</span></p> <!--[0--><pre><!---->Hash: GBO3OSMXODHKWDCJRYG3SFVKZH6LZLHJY7L7VUPDQKXO2266P3EQC<!----></pre><!--]--><!--]--><!--[3--><p><span>pijul $</span> <span>cat f.txt</span></p> <!--[0--><pre><!---->G\nA\nB<!----></pre><!--]--><!--]--><!--]--><!----></div></div><!--[0--><!--]--> <div><div><!--[--><!--[3--><p><span>git $</span> <span>printf 'A\\nB\\nG\\nA\\nB\\n' &gt; f.txt</span></p> <!--[-1--><!--]--><!--]--><!--[3--><p><span>git $</span> <span>git commit -am 'add A,B at top'</span></p> <!--[0--><pre><!---->[alice 77d3d8d] add A,B at top\n 1 file changed, 2 insertions(+)<!----></pre><!--]--><!--]--><!--[3--><p><span>git $</span> <span>cat f.txt</span></p> <!--[0--><pre><!---->A\nB\nG\nA\nB<!----></pre><!--]--><!--]--><!--]--><!----></div> <div><!--[--><!--[3--><p><span>pijul $</span> <span>printf 'A\\nB\\nG\\nA\\nB\\n' &gt; f.txt</span></p> <!--[-1--><!--]--><!--]--><!--[3--><p><span>pijul $</span> <span>pijul record -am 'add A,B at top'</span></p> <!--[0--><pre><!---->Hash: 6CIUP2TSLW6IXCX7G4RZR3WHY5SEM5BIU7U4LJX6TLOPY3XUYSOQC<!----></pre><!--]--><!--]--><!--[3--><p><span>pijul $</span> <span>cat f.txt</span></p> <!--[0--><pre><!---->A\nB\nG\nA\nB<!----></pre><!--]--><!--]--><!--]--><!----></div></div><!--[0--><!--]--> <div><div><!--[--><!--[3--><p><span>git $</span> <span>git checkout main</span></p> <!--[0--><pre><!---->Switched to branch 'main'<!----></pre><!--]--><!--]--><!--[3--><p><span>git $</span> <span>git checkout -b bob</span></p> <!--[0--><pre><!---->Switched to a new branch 'bob'<!----></pre><!--]--><!--]--><!--[3--><p><span>git $</span> <span>printf 'A\\nX\\nB\\n' &gt; f.txt</span></p> <!--[-1--><!--]--><!--]--><!--[3--><p><span>git $</span> <span>git commit -am 'insert X between originals'</span></p> <!--[0--><pre><!---->[bob 09b6f67] insert X between originals\n 1 file changed, 1 insertion(+)<!----></pre><!--]--><!--]--><!--[3--><p><span>git $</span> <span>git checkout main</span></p> <!--[0--><pre><!---->Switched to branch 'main'<!----></pre><!--]--><!--]--><!--[3--><p><span>git $</span> <span>git merge alice</span></p> <!--[0--><pre><!---->Updating 46fcdd3..77d3d8d\nFast-forward\n f.txt | 3 +++\n 1 file changed, 3 insertions(+)<!----></pre><!--]--><!--]--><!--[3--><p><span>git $</span> <span>git merge bob</span></p> <!--[0--><pre><!---->Auto-merging f.txt\nMerge made by the 'ort' strategy.\n f.txt | 1 +\n 1 file changed, 1 insertion(+)<!----></pre><!--]--><!--]--><!--[3--><p><span>git $</span> <span>cat f.txt</span></p> <!--[0--><pre><!---->A\nX\nB\nG\nA\nB<!----></pre><!--]--><!--]--><!--[0--><!--]--><!--]--><!----></div> <div><!--[--><!--[3--><p><span>pijul $</span> <span>pijul channel switch main</span></p> <!--[0--><pre><!---->Reset given paths to last recorded change<!----></pre><!--]--><!--]--><!--[3--><p><span>pijul $</span> <span>pijul fork bob</span></p> <!--[-1--><!--]--><!--]--><!--[3--><p><span>pijul $</span> <span>pijul channel switch bob</span></p> <!--[0--><pre><!---->Reset given paths to last recorded change<!----></pre><!--]--><!--]--><!--[3--><p><span>pijul $</span> <span>printf 'A\\nX\\nB\\n' &gt; f.txt</span></p> <!--[-1--><!--]--><!--]--><!--[3--><p><span>pijul $</span> <span>pijul record -am 'insert X between originals'</span></p> <!--[0--><pre><!---->Hash: F5CAUHH7IA2QMSRPNMX7LDQLCMKJKKKEGGACTZ7OXTSHYPDE3WFAC<!----></pre><!--]--><!--]--><!--[3--><p><span>pijul $</span> <span>pijul channel switch main</span></p> <!--[0--><pre><!---->Reset given paths to last recorded change<!----></pre><!--]--><!--]--><!--[3--><p><span>pijul $</span> <span>pijul fork merged</span></p> <!--[-1--><!--]--><!--]--><!--[3--><p><span>pijul $</span> <span>pijul channel switch merged</span></p> <!--[0--><pre><!---->Reset given paths to last recorded change<!----></pre><!--]--><!--]--><!--[3--><p><span>pijul $</span> <span>pijul pull --all . --from-channel alice</span></p> <!--[-1--><!--]--><!--]--><!--[3--><p><span>pijul $</span> <span>pijul pull --all . --from-channel bob</span></p> <!--[-1--><!--]--><!--]--><!--[3--><p><span>pijul $</span> <span>cat f.txt</span></p> <!--[0--><pre><!---->A\nB\nG\nA\nX\nB<!----></pre><!--]--><!--]--><!--[0--><!--]--><!--]--><!----></div></div><!--]--><!--]--></div><!----></div><!--]--><!----></main> </div></div>",
