    "title": "Need a break? Play todays game from The Daily Context.",
    "url": "https://dev.to/devteam/need-a-break-play-todays-game-from-the-daily-context-1fli",
    "text": "<div><div>\n    \n\n    <main>\n      <div>\n\n\n        <article>\n          \n          \n\n          <div>\n              \n  \n\n              <p>AI Engineer World's Fair Coverage</p>\n            <div>\n                <p>We (at DEV and MLH) are covering AI Engineer's World Fair by printing a physical newspaper called \"The Daily Context\" everyday of the conference.</p>\n\n<p>We wanted to include a game in each issue so for today's first edition, we published a little word search affectionately named \"Vector Search\":</p>\n\n\n\n<p>I built this game with AI Studio and deployed it to Cloud Run. It was super easy to put together and I love the little touches included in the game (answer reveal, confetti upon completion, etc). You can play it right here:</p>\n\n\n\n\n\n<p>I discovered a funny little \"bug\" this morning right when we were about to go live with the digital version of the paper.</p>\n\n<p>Or well, maybe I can't actually call it a bug. AI Studio went above and beyond and built me an app where the word search changed on every refresh as opposed to the static word search I had printed in the physical paper. The words being searched remained the same, which is why I didn't notice this immediately. </p>\n\n<p>While a new word search is definitely a better <em>gaming</em> experience, attendees were told to visit the digital version of The Daily Context for their answers so I had to quickly simplify the app to ensure the print and digital versions matched. Certainly a type of problem that wouldn't have happened pre-AI!  </p>\n\n\n<hr>\n\n<p>Thank you to everyone who responded to my post last week:</p>\n\n\n<div>\n  <p>Working on a silly project - share your favorite AI buzzwords/phrases and general key terms with me please!!</p><div>\n      <p>Niche jargon like RAG and LoRA\n\n</p><div>\n          <div>\n            <p>\n              Jess Lee\n            </p>\n\n          </div>\n          <p>Jun 22\n        </p></div>\n\n    <div>\n      <h2>\n        \n          Working on a silly project - share your favorite AI buzzwords/phrases and general key terms with me please!!\n        \n      </h2>\n        <p>#discuss\n            #ai\n        </p>\n      <div>\n        <p>\n            \n              \n                  \n                    \n                  \n                  \n                    \n                  \n                  \n                    \n                  \n              \n              26&nbsp;reactions\n            \n          \n            \n              \n\n              20&nbsp;comments\n            \n        </p>\n        <p><small>\n            1 min read\n          </small>\n            \n        </p>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n</div>\n\n\n<p>If you didn't see your words used today, I'm sure it will pop up in our other games this week. Stay tuned for tomorrow's puzzle!</p>\n\n\n            </div>\n\n              \n  \n\n              \n          </div>\n          \n\n\n\n\n        </article>\n\n        \n\n          <!-- Bottom content skipped via SKIP_BOTTOM_CONTENT config -->\n      </div>\n    </main>\n\n    \n  </div></div>",
