    "id": "tech_hn_47408727",
    "source": "HackerNews (TypeScript)",
    "category": "Technology",
    "title": "GitHub - chenxin-yan/crust: A TypeScript-first, Bun-native CLI framework with composable modules.",
    "url": "https://github.com/chenxin-yan/crust",
    "text": "<div><div><article>\n<p>A TypeScript-first, Bun-native CLI framework with composable modules.</p>\n\n<p>\n  Website &amp; Docs\n  <span>&nbsp;&nbsp;•&nbsp;&nbsp;</span>\n  Contributing\n  <span>&nbsp;&nbsp;•&nbsp;&nbsp;</span>\n  Issues\n  <span>&nbsp;&nbsp;•&nbsp;&nbsp;</span>\n  Discord\n</p>\n<p></p><h2>What is Crust?</h2><p></p>\n<p>Crust is a modern CLI framework built specifically for TypeScript and Bun. It provides a modular architecture for building command-line tools with features like command routing, argument parsing, interactive prompts, validation, and persistence—all with first-class TypeScript support.</p>\n<p></p><h2>Who uses Crust?</h2><p></p>\n<ul>\n<li>Nia CLI by Nozomio Labs</li>\n</ul>\n<p></p><h2>Getting Started</h2><p></p>\n<div><pre>bun create crust my-cli\n<span>cd</span> my-cli\nbun run dev</pre></div>\n<p></p><h2>Packages</h2><p></p>\n<markdown-accessiblity-table><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>Package</th>\n<th>Description</th>\n<th>Version</th>\n<th>Downloads</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td>@crustjs/crust</td>\n<td>CLI tooling — build and distribute standalone executables</td>\n<td></td>\n<td></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>@crustjs/core</td>\n<td>Core: command definition, arg parsing, routing, extensions, errors</td>\n<td></td>\n<td></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>@crustjs/man</td>\n<td>Generate man pages from Crust command definitions</td>\n<td></td>\n<td></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>@crustjs/testing</td>\n<td>Test harness for Crust CLI applications</td>\n<td></td>\n<td></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>@crustjs/extensions</td>\n<td>Official Extensions: help, version, completion</td>\n<td></td>\n<td></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>@crustjs/style</td>\n<td>Terminal styling foundation</td>\n<td></td>\n<td></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>@crustjs/progress</td>\n<td>Progress indicators for async CLI tasks</td>\n<td></td>\n<td></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>@crustjs/prompts</td>\n<td>Interactive terminal prompts</td>\n<td></td>\n<td></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>@crustjs/store</td>\n<td>DX-first, typed persistence for CLI apps with config/data/state/cache separation</td>\n<td></td>\n<td></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>@crustjs/skills</td>\n<td>Agent skill generation from Crust command definitions</td>\n<td></td>\n<td></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>@crustjs/create</td>\n<td>Headless scaffolding engine for building create-xxx tools</td>\n<td></td>\n<td></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>create-crust</td>\n<td>Project scaffolding tool</td>\n<td></td>\n<td></td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table></markdown-accessiblity-table>\n</article></div></div>",
